An explicitly empty --description is legal: only the description is written, and on update Linear stores it as an empty string.
-- seed.json --
{"Issue": [{"id": "1a000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000123", "identifier": "ENG-123", "title": "Existing issue", "state": "0d000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002", "description": "Old body"}]}
-- run --
linear issue update ENG-123 --json --unprotected --description ""
